!/docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md
!/docs/licenses/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
*.log
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.npy
*.npz
*.mat
*.zip
*.bundle
